.TH HSH 1 "MAY 2026" "Ahad Alqahtani" "Simple Shell Manual"
.SH NAME
hsh \- Simple UNIX command line interpreter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./hsh
.RI [ command ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
hsh is a simple UNIX command line interpreter that replicates the core behavior of /bin/sh. Supports interactive and non-interactive modes.
.SH BUILT-IN COMMANDS
.TP
.B exit
Exit the shell.
.TP
.B env
Print environment variables.
.TP
.B cd [DIRECTORY]
Change current directory. Defaults to HOME if no argument.
.SH ERROR HANDLING
.nf
./hsh: 1: command: not found
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sh (1),
.BR execve (2),
.BR fork (2)
